swagger.json is the containerlab API server's OpenAPI (Swagger 2) document,
copied unchanged from https://github.com/srl-labs/clab-api-server
(docs/swagger.json at commit a70e099b481bb2be7c873cbad506bb40e234c43f,
release v0.9.0, the image internal/testsupport.ClabAPIImage pins).

It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose text is in
LICENSE beside this file, copied unchanged from the same commit. Upstream's
LICENSE names no copyright holder and the repository carries no NOTICE file;
the work is the srl-labs/clab-api-server project's.

It is vendored only so the coverage ledger's operation list can be checked
against it offline (internal/archtest). Refresh it with the same file from a
newer release, then run go run ./tools/genledger.
